  "body": "Consider the test 'Show a sibling popover during \"hide all popovers until' merged in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/39647/files:\r\n\r\nwhen `p16.hidePopover()` is called, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-popover-algorithm invokes https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-all-popovers-until with element `p16`.\r\nIn https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-all-popovers-until, the first time after reaching step 6.3. `foundEndpoint` is true and `lastToHide` is null. In step 6.6., `repeatingHide` is set to true. Step 6.3. is executed again and `foundEnpoint`is true, `lastToHide` null and it will continue like that.",
